  "description": "Alterations to rear steps; replacement and enlargement of rear balcony and replacement of single-glazing in two rear doors with double-glazing",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "<p>The Development hereby permitted shall only be carried out and completed strictly in accordance with the submitted plans hereby approved and any subsequent approval of details.\r\n</p><p><br></p><p>\r\nREASON: To ensure that the development hereby permitted is carried out in full accordance with the plans hereby approved.\r\n</p>",
    "<p>The development hereby permitted must be begun not later than the expiration of three years beginning with the date of this permission.</p><p><br></p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\nREASON: In order to comply with the provisions of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).</p><p>\r\n</p>",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34); color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;&quot;&gt;All new works, and works of making good to the retained fabric, whether internal or external, shall be finished to match the original work with regard to the methods used and to material, dimensions, composition, form, colour, finish and profile, and in the case of brickwork, facebond and pointing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34); color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34); color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34); color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;&quot;&gt;REASON: To ensure that special regard is paid to protecting the special architectural and historic interest and integrity of the building&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;Details for the proposed materials of the rear steps, including product details and images of the proposed limestone shall be submitted to the local planning authority for approval prior to the commencement of development.&amp;nbsp; The development shall subsequently be carried out in accordance with the approved details.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;REASON:&amp;nbsp; In the interests of visual amenity and to preserve or enhance the character and appearance of the host listed building and the wider conservation area.&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
